  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:05.079" end="00:10.948" ttm:agent="v1">AV with that drip, ho</p>
      <p begin="00:10.948" end="00:12.448" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, like what the ****?</p>
      <p begin="00:12.331" end="00:14.431" ttm:agent="v1">Mother****er got a bullet through his lungs</p>
      <p begin="00:14.431" end="00:17.198" ttm:agent="v1">Keep a clutch, I pop a hollow and serve it to his gut</p>
      <p begin="00:17.198" end="00:19.965" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty ****, I'm in the function, don't mean to interrupt</p>
      <p begin="00:19.965" end="00:22.807" ttm:agent="v1">I got money that move it like groupies, I can't get enough</p>
      <p begin="00:22.807" end="00:25.964" ttm:agent="v1">I got a steel heater, pop a blue demon, in a two-seater</p>
      <p begin="00:25.964" end="00:27.751" ttm:agent="v1">Cool beamer, watch these two beat him</p>
      <p begin="00:27.751" end="00:29.439" ttm:agent="v1">When he move weird, I move deeper</p>
      <p begin="00:29.439" end="00:30.939" ttm:agent="v1">Why he move different?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.556" end="00:32.056" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta cool Ruger</p>
      <p begin="00:31.558" end="00:34.399" ttm:agent="v1">He a b***h, he a school teacher, I'm the school shooter</p>
      <p begin="00:34.399" end="00:36.855" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, sit down, I'm boutta teach a ****in' lesson</p>
      <p begin="00:36.855" end="00:39.704" ttm:agent="v1">Mother****ers acting crazy, guess I gotta keep 'em guessin'?</p>
      <p begin="00:39.704" end="00:42.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Just a bunch of ****ing clowns (haha)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.578" end="00:45.844" ttm:agent="v1">One bat to the head, who the **** is laughing now?</p>
      <p begin="00:45.844" end="00:48.555" ttm:agent="v1">You wanna step to me? I'll let it end for free</p>
      <p begin="00:48.555" end="00:51.554" ttm:agent="v1">I got a lotta ****ing demons, I'm the centerpiece</p>
      <p begin="00:51.554" end="00:54.393" ttm:agent="v1">Hell is meant for me, go 'head and bend your knees</p>
      <p begin="00:54.393" end="00:55.893" ttm:agent="v1">Take a swing, b***h, this'll be your ending scene</p>
      <p begin="00:55.790" end="00:57.574" ttm:agent="v1">I'll break your mother****ing face</p>
      <p begin="00:57.574" end="01:01.581" ttm:agent="v1">When I feel the bass I cut like razor ****in' blade, I put 'em in a grave</p>
      <p begin="01:01.581" end="01:04.113" ttm:agent="v1">Run away 'cause a p***y mother****a' never wanna be the one to face</p>
      <p begin="01:04.113" end="01:07.800" ttm:agent="v1">The entity sending the ****ers well beneath to a sunken place</p>
      <p begin="01:07.800" end="01:09.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I know you know my name (**** you)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.967" end="01:10.876" ttm:agent="v1">Pull up on a mother****er, get out the whip, I gotta let shit rip</p>
      <p begin="01:10.876" end="01:12.708" ttm:agent="v1">**** another one, I gotta do it alone</p>
      <p begin="01:12.708" end="01:14.208" ttm:agent="v1">I really gotta be the one to make a name done stick</p>
      <p begin="01:13.861" end="01:17.103" ttm:agent="v1">So b***h, don't even try to save me 'Cause I'm too far in the abyss</p>
      <p begin="01:17.103" end="01:18.689" ttm:agent="v1">I stay ****ing decaying, don't play me</p>
      <p begin="01:18.689" end="01:20.189" ttm:agent="v1">ayy, like what the ****?</p>
      <p begin="01:19.918" end="01:21.957" ttm:agent="v1">Mother****er got a bullet through his lungs</p>
      <p begin="01:21.957" end="01:24.810" ttm:agent="v1">Keep a clutch, I pop a hollow and serve it to his gut</p>
      <p begin="01:24.810" end="01:27.628" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty ****, I'm in the function, don't mean to interrupt</p>
      <p begin="01:27.628" end="01:30.342" ttm:agent="v1">I got money that move it like groupies, I can't get enough</p>
      <p begin="01:30.342" end="01:33.592" ttm:agent="v1">I got a steel heater, pop a blue demon, in a two-seater</p>
      <p begin="01:33.592" end="01:35.339" ttm:agent="v1">Cool beamer, watch these two beat him</p>
      <p begin="01:35.339" end="01:37.088" ttm:agent="v1">When he move weird, I move deeper</p>
      <p begin="01:37.088" end="01:38.588" ttm:agent="v1">Why he move different?</p>
      <p begin="01:38.184" end="01:39.684" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta cool Ruger</p>
      <p begin="01:39.138" end="01:41.083" ttm:agent="v1">He a b***h, he a school teacher, I'm the school shooter</p>
      <p begin="01:41.083" end="01:45.116" ttm:agent="v1">Watch a mother****in' break</p>
      <p begin="01:45.116" end="01:46.866" ttm:agent="v1">B***h, what the **** do you want?</p>
      <p begin="01:46.866" end="01:48.366" ttm:agent="v1">Bullet to ya' dome</p>
      <p begin="01:47.992" end="01:50.961" ttm:agent="v1">Got a ****in' bag, now I'm creepin' out the catacombs</p>
      <p begin="01:50.961" end="01:52.469" ttm:agent="v1">B***h, what the **** you talkin'?</p>
      <p begin="01:52.469" end="01:53.969" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma bring the MAC from home</p>
      <p begin="01:53.816" end="01:56.664" ttm:agent="v1">Yo' b***h, she wanna **** on me and her friend, she wanna tag along</p>
      <p begin="01:56.664" end="01:59.279" ttm:agent="v1">You know I'm needin' my profit, you p***ies speakin' like prophets</p>
      <p begin="01:59.279" end="02:02.638" ttm:agent="v1">So ****in' back up and stop it, I spin yo' jaw like a sprocket, I'm poppin'</p>
      <p begin="02:02.638" end="02:05.357" ttm:agent="v1">I got my racks up like nothin', she want my d**k in her stomach</p>
      <p begin="02:05.357" end="02:09.357" ttm:agent="v1">Got.40 rounds in this clip and Got forty bands in the function, like what the ****?</p>
